WEBVTT

00:35:59.167 --> 00:36:01.726
For more of Christiana's work,
check out her new book,

00:36:01.750 --> 00:36:03.018
"The Future We Choose,"

00:36:03.042 --> 00:36:05.583
and her podcast, "Outrage and Optimism."

00:36:06.285 --> 00:36:09.226
For their research, thanks to
Kenneth Thomas and Ralph Kilmann

00:36:09.250 --> 00:36:10.518
on conflict styles,

00:36:10.542 --> 00:36:12.809
Greg Northcraft
and Maggie Neale on anchoring,

00:36:12.833 --> 00:36:15.893
Adam Galinsky, Thomas Mussweiler,
Chris Guthrie and Dan Orr

00:36:15.917 --> 00:36:17.184
on first offers,

00:36:17.208 --> 00:36:19.559
Dan Ames and Malia Mason on ranges,

00:36:19.583 --> 00:36:22.768
Hannah Riley Bowles and Linda Babcock
on relational accounts,

00:36:22.792 --> 00:36:25.143
Bruce Barry and Ray Friedman
on intelligence,

00:36:25.167 --> 00:36:28.393
Carsten De Dreu and colleagues
on helping others get what they want,

00:36:28.417 --> 00:36:29.976
Geoff Leonardelli and colleagues

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:32.059
on multiple equivalent
simultaneous offers,